  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The submitted details, due to insufficient information, fail to demonstrate compliance with Conditions 4 and 5 of planning permission P/2024/2393, dated 13/09/2024. The submission does not include a suitably detailed car park layout with clearly marked parking bays, nor does it provide vehicle-tracking diagrams to demonstrate safe access and egress arrangements. Furthermore, the Transport Statement submitted does not assess the impact of peak-time drop-off and pick-up trips associated with the development.\r\nAccordingly, the proposal fails to comply with Local Plan Policy EC2, which seeks to ensure the safety of pedestrians and vehicles, and to support sustainable transport objectives and road safety.\r\n"
  ],
